          "timestamp": "2026-06-27T19:18:00",
          "text": "Hi team, I was reading about SmartSuggest and thought it would be useful to discuss some of its weaknesses. It seems they struggle with real-time updates during high traffic periods, have limited language support outside major global languages, and there are potential privacy concerns due to their extensive data collection.",
